      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{603fbe1486b8a2467efdd979|full_name}: While yes it might be possible to bypass, my whole point was that if you have that extra step already there usually is no need to add anything further. 2FA is a part of that step to stop access to an account even if they have the username and password.",
      "viewerReactions": null
